# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ComfyUI-WindMix
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Editors / OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local backups — keep these OUTSIDE the plugin folder, never inside
*.bak
*.bak_*
*_bak_*
*.orig
*.tmp
backup/
backup_*/
*副本*

# Runtime state written by ComfyUI.
# These folders are auto-recreated on first launch
# (see prompt_studio/api.py::_ensure_dirs), so they never belong in git.
prompt_studio/storage/prompt_data/
prompt_studio/storage/notes/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data — MUST NOT be published.
#
# group_tags/custom.yaml : auto-copied from <lang>.yaml on first edit
#                          (api.py::_ensure_custom_group_tags_file). Holds your
#                          own tag edits.
# group_tags/prepend.yaml: hand-written extras, merged IN FRONT of the main
#                          list. Read-only in code — you created it.
# group_tags/append.yaml : same mechanism, merged AFTER the main list.
#                          (Nothing is written if absent — safe to ignore.)
# presets/preset_text.json : your saved presets. Auto-recreated empty by
#                          api.py::_wm_read_presets when missing.
# presets/images/        : images you attached to presets.
#
# The shipped tag libraries (zh_CN.yaml, default.yaml, de_DE.yaml, ...) ARE
# published — new users need them, so they are deliberately NOT listed here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
prompt_studio/storage/group_tags/custom.yaml
prompt_studio/storage/group_tags/prepend.yaml
prompt_studio/storage/group_tags/append.yaml
presets/preset_text.json
presets/images/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# wildcards/ — the tag libraries themselves are personal and stay local.
#
# The FOLDER must survive the clone: Wind_WildcardConcat_Dynamic.py resolves
# its default path from <repo>/wildcards, and while a missing dir does not
# crash anything, the node UI would point at a path that isn't there.
# So: ignore every file inside, then explicitly re-include the README that
# documents the expected format.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
wildcards/*
!wildcards/README.md

# 6 组 emoji 词库随插件分发（作者自建，已确认可公开）
!wildcards/🏞️ 场景.txt
!wildcards/👗人物服装.txt
!wildcards/💇 发型.txt
!wildcards/🖼️ 构图.txt
!wildcards/😊 面部表情.txt
!wildcards/🧘 肢体动作.txt
